.DS_Store

# Personal training artefacts. They are generated next to the operator's
# database by `roca calibrate` / `roca init` from that machine's own corpus.
# Committing either would leak the operator's questions, project names and
# routing model into the git history forever (2026-08-05).
queryplan_examples.txt
classifier.roca
